 6	 *         correct fields (summary, lastAction, logFilename, hasStageActivity).
 7	 *   AC-2: summary matches existing behavior (same string as before the refactor).
 8	 *   AC-3: lastAction contains the action field of the entry that produced summary.
 9	 *   AC-4: logFilename contains the basename of the JSONL file read.
